/*
 * Copyright (C) 2020-2026 EDGEMTech SA <info@edgemtech.ch>
 *
 * AVZ ITS for the Toradex Verdin iMX8MP. Carries only the AVZ hypervisor
 * binary (so3.bin) + the AVZ device tree. The guest lives in a SEPARATE
 * ITB (verdin-imx8mp_linux_guest.its); both are loaded by U-Boot's
 * guest-boot command, which passes the AVZ FIT in x0 and the guest ITB
 * in x1.
 *
 * Template: ${IB_*_PATH} placeholders are expanded to absolute build
 * paths by bsp_render_its (bsp.bbclass) at do_itb time.
 *
 * The bare path uses verdin-imx8mp.its instead — see that file for the
 * single-ITB bootm variant without AVZ.
 *
